BOUNTY COLLECTION PROCEDURE
Issued by the treasury (Kakuzu). Compliance mandatory.

1. Bounties supplement organisation funds between extractions. Every member is
   self-financing; the treasury converts corpses and contracts into ryo.
2. Identify the target's registered bounty before engagement. A body with no listed
   price is wasted effort - confirm value first.
3. On a kill, preserve the head or the marker the exchange requires. Some contracts
   demand proof of identity; deliver it intact.
4. Route all collection through cut-out brokers at designated exchange stations.
   No member presents himself directly to a village bounty office.
5. Full sums are remitted to the treasury. Skimming is theft from the organisation
   and is handled as such.
6. Do not pursue low-value bounties on organisation time when a beast is in play.

A ninja who understands money outlives one who understands only jutsu. - K.
